{"4316920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beneath the Snow Veil", "steam_appid": 4316920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggling to survive in the frozen tomb of civilization.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Beneath the Snow Veil&gt; is a survival-building game centered around exploring urban ruins. In the remnants of a modern city swallowed by a blizzard, you will face the ultimate tests of extreme cold, hunger, and loneliness.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explore Lethal Ruins: Navigate through the wreckage of skyscrapers, subway tunnels, and abandoned malls, scavenging for supplies amid the snow veil—where every shift in visibility could mean life or death.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Genuine Survival Challenges: Manage body temperature, search for clean water, and defend against unknown dangers, relying only on the city’s remaining resources for hope.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Rebuild the Last Stronghold: Transform the final shelter of the post-apocalyptic world into the survival fortress of your imagination.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, there are no heroic epics—only a concrete jungle cloaked in frost and your unwavering will to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggling to survive in the frozen tomb of civilization.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Beneath the Snow Veil&gt; is a survival-building game centered around exploring urban ruins. In the remnants of a modern city swallowed by a blizzard, you will face the ultimate tests of extreme cold, hunger, and loneliness.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explore Lethal Ruins: Navigate through the wreckage of skyscrapers, subway tunnels, and abandoned malls, scavenging for supplies amid the snow veil—where every shift in visibility could mean life or death.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Genuine Survival Challenges: Manage body temperature, search for clean water, and defend against unknown dangers, relying only on the city’s remaining resources for hope.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Rebuild the Last Stronghold: Transform the final shelter of the post-apocalyptic world into the survival fortress of your imagination.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, there are no heroic epics—only a concrete jungle cloaked in frost and your unwavering will to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "&quot;Beneath the Snow Veil&quot; is an exploration survival game set in a frigid, post-apocalyptic world. Amid extreme weather and deadly cold, explore ruins, craft tools, repair and upgrade your shelter to withstand freezing temperatures, hunger, and lurking threats.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316920/883a38e29c6d9d84f918ac58402539641e9f0b4c/header.jpg?t=1772207491", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316920/daceee2d4ecea8244b1c51648566f2bf46d0c1bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772207491", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316920/daceee2d4ecea8244b1c51648566f2bf46d0c1bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772207491", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-3570K 3.4 GHz 4 Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i9-9900K 3.6 GHz 8 Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 2070</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</stron